1
00:00:06,185 --> 00:00:08,515
(Penny:)-Hey, Sheldon.
-Oh, Penny, excellent.

2
00:00:08,687 --> 00:00:12,107
(Sheldon:)I have a question
about these maxi pads.

3
00:00:12,733 --> 00:00:17,403
(Sheldon:)Are the wings truly functional
or have I fallen victim to marketing hype?

4
00:00:18,280 --> 00:00:21,160
(Penny:)What? What are you
doing with--? What?

5
00:00:21,367 --> 00:00:25,037
(Sheldon:)The stock boy at Walgreens was
frustratingly uninformed on the subject.

6
00:00:25,246 --> 00:00:27,666
(Penny:)Sheldon, what are you doing
with maxi pads?

7
00:00:27,831 --> 00:00:32,001
SHELDON: I have a lady friend who will
be staying with me for a few days.

8
00:00:32,169 --> 00:00:33,299
PENNY:
Oh.

9
00:00:33,504 --> 00:00:34,584
(Raj:)What?

10
00:00:34,755 --> 00:00:36,335
SHELDON:
I want her to feel at home.

11
00:00:36,507 --> 00:00:40,807
(Sheldon:)I also bought scented soaps,
pantyhose, Midol, calcium chews...

12
00:00:40,970 --> 00:00:43,890
(Sheldon:)...and what is apparently a yogurt
specifically designed...

13
00:00:44,056 --> 00:00:46,596
(Sheldon:)...to regulate the female bowel.

14
00:00:48,269 --> 00:00:49,689
(Penny:)Wait. Wait, hold on. Back up.

15
00:00:49,853 --> 00:00:51,773
(Penny:)You're having a woman stay with you?

16
00:00:51,939 --> 00:00:55,649
(Sheldon:)Yes. Why does that seem
to flabbergast everybody?

17
00:00:55,818 --> 00:00:57,488
PENNY:
No, no, no, I'm not flabbergasted.

18
00:00:57,653 --> 00:00:59,233
(Penny:)I'm puzzled.

19
00:00:59,405 --> 00:01:01,655
(Penny:)Yeah, let's go with puzzled.

